         <!--((monogramma Christi cum alpha et omega)) / benemerenti / Valeriae quae / vixit annos / XXXVII deposita / XIIII kalendas / martias post con/sulatu Gratian/i et Dagalaifi ((avis))--><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/><g type="descriptive">monogramma Christi cum alpha et omega</g><lb n="2"/>benemerenti<lb n="3"/>Valeriae quae<lb n="4"/>vixit annos<lb n="5"/>XXXVII deposita<lb n="6"/>XIIII kalendas<lb n="7"/>martias post con<lb break="no" n="8"/>sulatu Gratian<lb break="no" n="9"/>i et Dagalaifi <g type="descriptive">avis</g></ab></div>
         <div type="apparatus">
            <p>Silvagni, in ICVR ad loc. cit. quotes Gruter ("in rotundo marmore candido") and de Rossi: "rotundos huiuscemodi lapides ad basilicarum pavimenta pertinere certo constat, iisque epitaphia incidi placuisse aliis quoque exemplis didici"</p>
         </div>
      </body>
